text = "So you've noticed too. Good -- I thought I was overreacting. I'm an herbalist; I've been studying this for weeks. The well water has a mineral residue that only comes from moonstone ore. The old mine east of here was sealed twenty years ago, but seals fail. Something's broken through and it's poisoning the groundwater."
