speaker = "Mara"
text = "I'm an herbalist. I've been in this valley most of my life and I've never seen animals behave like this. The well water tastes wrong too -- I've been testing it. I think it's coming from the old moonstone mine east of here. Something's breached the old seal and it's leaking into the groundwater. I need someone who can get inside and stop it."
